cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this evaluation suite or its archived runs, please cite the paper it
  was built for rather than this repository alone.
title: >-
  Evaluation suite and archived runs for "Localizing a Safety-Related Regression
  Across Configurations of a Migraine-Care LLM Application"
abstract: >-
  The 87-case behaviour-first evaluation suite, the evaluated persona prompt and
  function schemas, the archived discovery runs, and independent balanced and
  heldout replications. Each evidence layer is verified separately and is not
  pooled with the others. Retrieved corpus passages appear as their length only,
  for copyright reasons, and one in-house guidance document is pseudonymised.
  The model-run and gate results recompute from the recorded decisions; the
  annotation agreement ships in aggregate, because the annotators' per-item
  labels are held outside the repository.
